<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Joe White rejects latest Ridley bid.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Joe White rejects latest Ridley bid.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Joe White Maltings Ltd said on Friday that an increased takeover offer by Ridley Corp Ltd remained inadequate.  </p>
<p>&quot;Ridley's increased offer of A$5.30 recognises, in the clearest possible way, the validity of the board's earlier comment that the initial offer of A$4.85 was inadequate,&quot; Joe White chairman S.E.K. Hulme said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The board is of the firm view that despite the increase the offer remains inadequate,&quot; Hulme said.</p>
</text>
